    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><div>SDDC Lifecycle 9.1.0.0200 Release Notes</div></h1>\n<div><div class=\"p\"><div>This document contains the following sections</div></div><ul class=\"ul\"><div><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0200/sddc-lifecycle-9-1-0-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-980b16c8-7090-4e71-b1b4-d5614fad6308\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Introduction</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0200/sddc-lifecycle-9-1-0-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-b851f386-8320-4028-933d-2445a27cfd0a\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">What's New</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0200/sddc-lifecycle-9-1-0-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-760ee03b-bd80-445b-a9c9-e5bab57b27e7\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Applying the Patch</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0200/sddc-lifecycle-9-1-0-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-f96a92e2-814d-424f-a99d-11425d6365c1\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Resolved Issues</a></div></li></div></ul><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-980b16c8-7090-4e71-b1b4-d5614fad6308\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Introduction</div></h2>\n<table class=\"table\">\n<div>\n<!--cq:include script=\"../../common/tablestack.jsp\" /-->\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100.0%\"/></colgroup>\n<div>\n<tbody class=\"tbody\"><div>\n<tr class=\"row\"><div><td class=\"entry relcol\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-7f15c69c-326a-434e-af52-32bdfba5f55d\"><div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-52da1eb6-bf78-4638-9f9c-aa39aecd48b2\"><div>SDDC Lifecycle 9.1.0.0200 | 25 JUN 2026 | Build 25495903</div></div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-f290bf77-f9ca-4b38-9192-0236b3ed9981\"><div>Check for additions and updates to these release notes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-ef611c70-51c9-4612-f4cc-1679080013c6\"><div>For information about release types and dependencies, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vcf_527&amp;appid=vcf-9-1&amp;language=en&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Lifecycle Management</a> documentation.</div></div>\n</div></td></div></tr>\n</div></tbody>\n</div>\n</div>\n</table>\n</div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-b851f386-8320-4028-933d-2445a27cfd0a\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>What's New</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-6d8fbef5-ec5b-43b6-a098-8d896d0bbb51\"><div>This release delivers a fix as described in the Resolved Issues section.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-760ee03b-bd80-445b-a9c9-e5bab57b27e7\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Applying the Patch</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-2f034716-12db-4b4d-abaf-cd80de87bb4a\"><div>You apply this patch by using VCF Operations. See <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vcf_535&amp;appid=vcf-9-1&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Upgrade or Patch an Individual VCF Component</a>.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-f96a92e2-814d-424f-a99d-11425d6365c1\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Resolved Issues</div></h2></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-5859821f-29d6-4878-9233-9539023a5689\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-1f48802a-be5b-4341-854b-91b4281ae0e0\"><div><b class=\"ph b\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-600700b6-0318-476a-8cb6-22b7a2a4183d\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF Automation upgrade might fail if SDDC lifecycle cannot communicate with SDDC Manager</div></b></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-ce391c2e-cf69-4273-9b34-7e27480ae9fc\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-cf24072a-18d1-48ad-b72b-b59b7b17e312-en_id-f2cd0cde-9e28-4dac-ef68-bb0b5e14af6b\"><div>SDDC lifecycle uses a Service Account to communicate with SDDC Manager APIs. During the periodic Service Account rotation, such an account might be corrupted when it is close to expiration, approximately 30 days from installation. As a result, if you do not deploy VCF Automation within 50 days after upgrading to or deploying VCF 9.1, the VCF Automation upgrade fails.</div></div></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
