    "title": "Log Management 9.1.0.0400 Release Notes",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><div>Log Management 9.1.0.0400 Release Notes</div></h1>\n<div><div class=\"p\"><div>This document contains the following sections</div></div><ul class=\"ul\"><div><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0400/log-management-9-1-0-0400-release-notes.html#GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-cba0acd6-b0f5-464d-8fd8-1d8ad0326a6a\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Introduction</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0400/log-management-9-1-0-0400-release-notes.html#GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-088941d7-f735-4858-accf-2c82c777d324\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">What's New</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0400/log-management-9-1-0-0400-release-notes.html#GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-eedec210-f95c-4984-ae3a-c8b130e26d40\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Applying the Patch</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-0-x/vcf-operations/9-1-0-0400/log-management-9-1-0-0400-release-notes.html#GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-70d2c13f-e185-4700-abe6-7a635cf11226\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Resolved Issues</a></div></li></div></ul><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-cba0acd6-b0f5-464d-8fd8-1d8ad0326a6a\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Introduction</div></h2>\n<table class=\"table\">\n<div>\n<!--cq:include script=\"../../common/tablestack.jsp\" /-->\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100.0%\"/></colgroup>\n<div>\n<tbody class=\"tbody\"><div>\n<tr class=\"row\"><div><td class=\"entry relcol\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-39e5e63a-befd-4401-a097-019d9d361c26\"><div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-7af7e2f9-bbf9-4fba-8b1d-3dd2b004149e\"><div>Log Management 9.1.0.0400 | 13 JUL 2026 | Build 25544947</div></div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-bd41ce2b-b490-4f20-83aa-131803f99b8e\"><div>Check for additions and updates to these release notes.</div></div>\n</div></td></div></tr>\n</div></tbody>\n</div>\n</div>\n</table>\n</div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-088941d7-f735-4858-accf-2c82c777d324\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>What's New</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-f3cbee38-dc89-489e-b9e3-361ff1f72a1a\"><div>This release contains various security enhancements and delivers fixes as described in the Resolved Issues section.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-eedec210-f95c-4984-ae3a-c8b130e26d40\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Applying the Patch</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-eacf5fb6-ec03-413f-80d0-566171024711\"><div>You apply this patch by using VCF Operations. See <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vcf_535&amp;appid=vcf-9-1&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Upgrade or Patch an Individual VCF Component</a>.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-70d2c13f-e185-4700-abe6-7a635cf11226\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Resolved Issues</div></h2></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-34818c87-ed82-483e-9f67-41356807efa5\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-35eb939f-6553-453b-b80c-07e9c237d117\"><div><b class=\"ph b\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-583aee6f-ef03-4aa9-a911-905926646d85\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Fixed an error when configuring the Integrated Load Balancer VIP after updating the storage size.</div></b></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-eb15e1eb-e07d-41db-acf4-defeb5d0c784\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-a2b1bf29-21da-4628-ae20-3c8c60f89443\"><div>The error <b class=\"ph b\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-11153dbd-f3fe-4c0a-95fc-fe5cc82120b3\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">The VMSP operation (Create or Delete) failed</div></b> no longer occurs when you add a Virtual IP (VIP) under <b class=\"ph b\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-3b0c5cb9-9b6c-4304-91dd-af9f6622dad0\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Operate &gt; Administration &gt; Configurations &gt; Log Collection &gt; Integrated Load Balancer</div></b> after modifying the storage size. This occurred with any input in GB which was not divisible by 256.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-8ff3fe45-f0cd-4df8-91d4-b763f83f351b\"><div> </div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-22464081-6fdf-42b3-88f5-f20c5e8970dc\"><div> </div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-77fcf26b-5edb-4747-b8ac-c3f796d8aebf-en_id-17e00af4-52e0-407b-9152-d6eba3c25e56\"><div> </div></div></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
