"entry vertical-align-middle relcol\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-e9ca0f00-7f64-41ef-870e-db9b12880626\"><div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-8930163d-d2dd-47ac-afc1-f7318f2d421f\"><div>962b6a6442bee9ae5d0988ca2b1ef9b1c7cba5aeb2c8fe9a69df696a44409a3f</div></div>\n</div></td></div></tr>\n</div></tbody>\n</div>\n</div>\n</table>\n</div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_applying-the-patch\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" data-outputclass=\"bc-h3\"><div>Applying the Patch</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-23fb713b-dbae-45bb-af1d-eb7bb59f1bf9\"><div>Log in to the <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://support.broadcom.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Broadcom Support Portal</a> to download this patch, depending on your entitlement.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-f6deb08c-d0f4-401d-a211-9483f5ea904c\"><div>For download instructions, see <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article?articleId=142814\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Download Broadcom products and software</a>.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-74d7bf0c-477c-46bb-f565-7f5256aaefca\"><div>For more information on using the vCenter shells, see Broadcom knowledge base article <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://kb.vmware.com/s/article/2100508\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">2100508</a>.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-4e68bc66-3827-4367-f13f-0cb690dbdbde\"><div>For VCF environments, you apply this patch by using VCF Operations. See <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vcf_535&amp;appid=vcf-9-1&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Upgrade or Patch an Individual VCF Component</a>.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-944b04b3-539f-4412-832e-2085ebebbce1\"><div>For VMware vSphere Foundation environments, see <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vsphclient_110&amp;appid=vsphere-9-1&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Upgrading the vCenter Appliance</a>.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_known-issues\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Known Issues</div></h2></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-1e3d9a51-61d8-4223-a705-044bbef2bc05\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-9f31c51c-5dab-4521-a9da-6a9f93c2ab07\"><div><b class=\"ph b\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-f6ac646c-6de2-45a9-9a1e-9db1b72924bd\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">A reset of the vSphere Lifecycle Manager database might cause data loss in the Supervisor</div></b></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-ee248f49-f421-42c4-af1c-1eaffc7a97c0\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-a4ee1a10-4479-4f02-ef02-8ab1d505e7ac\"><div>If the vSphere Lifecycle Manager database in your environment is reset before upgrading vCenter from versions 8.0 Update 3 and later or 9.0.x to 9.1.0 or 9.1.1, the upgrade might cause data loss in the Supervisor. To avoid data loss, before a vCenter upgrade, you must first check your environment and take mitigation steps, if necessary. </div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-3091d9b8-5e9b-4e89-d092-a0c251883744\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-52cd78b0-603d-4e3e-9f1d-3e52f7514025-en_id-95ea4617-3c58-4a1c-f5e3-839edeaad192\"><div>Workaround: See Broadcom knowledge base article <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/455737\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">455737</a> for instructions how to check if your environment is affected and for mitigation steps.</div></div></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
