  "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/dsm/data-services-manager/9-1/getting-started-with-vmware-data-services-manager/managing-dsm-plugin-software-updates/check-for-upgrades-from-the-vsphere-client.html": {
    "title": "Check for Data Services Manager Upgrades by Using the vSphere Client",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic task\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en\" lang=\"en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_GUID-38E30E01-19F0-4869-834C-A7738FC1D08F\"><div>Check for <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-da08cb36-b2f7-4411-f43a-11960852d3cb\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Data Services Manager</div></span> Upgrades by Using the <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-59166f26-461a-4241-9439-f0bae53a0a2c\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Client</div></span></div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-8e1a8735-68b8-436c-9969-8288ab70fd64\"><div>\n    As a <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-af29e91d-6eb9-4066-926b-0ade6c3215e8\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere</div></span> administrator, you can check for available plug-in upgrades from the <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-bd0c30cd-ae67-4b03-b936-89216bd3dc8a\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Client</div></span>.</div></div>\n<div><ol class=\"ol steps\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_STEPS_488CFDD4-A2DB-445D-B24F-90888111643E\"><div><li class=\"li step\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_STEP_06A1AB24-3FEB-4C2B-ACA2-75A3F783C4FC\"><div><span class=\"ph cmd\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_GUID-39977B68-7239-4E56-A0D6-484FD2F1344F\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Log in to the <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-131fdf33-7536-489d-86d7-3d85405c6ac5\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Client</div></span> and select the <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-717c219f-f809-4f06-cdb1-93e65dbfa84f\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vCenter</div></span> instance where the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-4d1e9b06-ebce-4aa0-826f-a4877be2bf99\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Data Services Manager</div></span> provider VM is registered.</div></span></div></li><li class=\"li step\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-0a0a0bab-ed6c-4756-b1cc-6e405d362769\"><div><span class=\"ph cmd\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-2e96756f-9a7c-4305-c4c7-db1d0e361287\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Click the <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-58f6a250-1bcf-4756-a793-b43ca17d6416\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Configure</div></span> tab, and under <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-51cf1a62-0416-4bb0-f930-7b20e441fd35\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VMware Data Services Manager</div></span>, click <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-02be821d-f339-4198-a577-a59bdab27591\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Version &amp; Upgrade</div></span>.</div></span></div></li><li class=\"li step\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-8e563588-56d4-4673-fb6b-252d880cc3bf\"><div><span class=\"ph cmd\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-5625d155-8f22-4c33-a30f-49d87b31c206\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Under the <span class=\"keyword wintitle\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-4bd2da55-b227-463e-e841-fb0d2aa7f864\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Available Upgrades &amp; History</div></span> section, click the <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-297afeeb-58c1-4b3b-b731-489d7b79da33\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Available Upgrades</div></span> tab.</div></span></div></li><li class=\"li step\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_STEP_9CD432E6-C1C1-4823-89E2-03286BB6E71A\"><div><span class=\"ph cmd\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_GUID-548392AC-B51B-4A43-A08C-4EC6613F8BE6\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-282ba405-21f9-4fee-bbb5-12e0ae62f5a3\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Check for Upgrade</div></span>.</div></span></div></li></div></ol><section class=\"section postreq\" data-label=\"AFTER COMPLETING THE TASK\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-55a25753-0c3a-42a4-900e-2280d6bed930\"><div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-ab82321a-95d9-4aa7-cbf3-f4b8dc4cca25\"><div>If any updates are available, they appear in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol\" id=\"GUID-90D0565D-2318-4B47-9066-5961F556946B-en_id-3c713c41-447e-4349-dd89-30af45b75334\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">Available Upgrades</div></span> table.</div></div>\n</div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/dsm/data-services-manager/9-1/getting-started-with-vmware-data-services-manager/managing-dsm-plugin-software-updates/check-for-upgrades-from-the-vsphere-client.html",
    "subpages": []
  },
