  "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/planning-and-preparation.html": {
    "title": "Planning and Preparation",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-442f4ed8-8dc9-46f3-f2d7-b233196c10af\"><div>Planning and Preparation</div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-279a72db-1f82-4afc-a518-ff19beeb6d67\"><div>As a VI administrator, size your environment and create a specification of the software, tools, and external services that are required to build a <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-c6a9e13a-82ba-49ba-966f-1946a09aec89\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> private cloud.</div></div>\n<div><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-565419da-81f5-4c91-913a-7572cac19024\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-a40e629f-8143-439e-c3e5-b5a86ec33224\"><div>\n<span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-f9ce4fe4-3304-4714-f7de-6f0b0f1126fe\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> Planning and Preparation Workbook</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-f803ded8-f6e4-451d-fdfa-3e2cedaf6f5c\"><div>The workbook is a Microsoft Excel file that helps you gather the inputs that are required for deploying a <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-afd9c876-5a33-4fc2-829f-4c52c473ea53\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> fleet including workload domains, <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-708a2323-48c0-4242-bbdf-0ff315eb6fcb\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF Identity Broker</div></span>, <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-825591c3-378c-4b0b-9698-94cc2e383762\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Supervisor</div></span>, and <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-398e2a31-cc99-4ec4-a6d2-38996e3bd8f5\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF Automation</div></span>. You use the <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/content/dam/broadcom/techdocs/us/en/assets/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9.0-planning-and-preparation-workbook.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\"><span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-908d9d78-219f-4d34-c659-e5d4c732f34a\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> Planning and Preparation Workbook</a> for understanding the prerequisites for deploying the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-546a64ab-2355-4734-f544-fcb2c7595ac6\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> fleet and <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-15d5dcfe-28d1-4302-aeb5-0d6033b21c86\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> Instances, sizing your environment, as a dynamic <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-65fd97c7-da9a-4642-c8c9-873b24859ba2\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> environment specification, for updating requirements according to your design, and more.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-0096c379-c252-4ed5-b46c-1c3f697fca06\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_1\"><div>\n<span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_2\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> Planning Tools</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_3\"><div>You can use the <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://configmax.broadcom.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">VMware Configurations Maximums</a> and <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://ports.broadcom.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">VMware Ports and Protocols</a> tools to plan the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_6\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> setup that can run your end user workloads according to the requirements of your organization.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-9fa7747a-de65-4265-fa0e-0a97d9d16b9f\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_7\"><div>Getting to Know <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_8\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span></div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_9\"><div>To apply this documentation, you must be acquainted with the <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Product Overview</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/design.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Design</a>, and <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/release-notes.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Release Notes</a>. For information about how to get onboarded to <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-2f4a0f8a-4938-40df-9eb9-29bd05fccb66\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span>, see <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/deployment/overview-of-deploy--converge--and-upgrade.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Overview of VCF Deploy, Converge, and Upgrade</a>.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_id-dfed9434-2f68-417e-c960-3e0e9ab1a5e7\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_13\"><div>SDKs, APIs, and CLI for <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_14\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> Administration</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_15\"><div>You can build, operate, and manage your <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_16\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> private cloud by using the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_17\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> SDK and APIs, and <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-631db32a-0ad4-4441-a467-c8aa7a71c1d5-en_div_18\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> PowerCLI. See <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/administration-sdks-cli-and-tools.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Administration SDKs, APIs, and CLI</a>. </div></div></div></section></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/planning-and-preparation.html",
    "subpages": []
  },
