    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-0f632dcd-3ac8-47d0-f85f-ba3983079b65\"><div>Release Notes</div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-0775f12e-af51-483e-980d-ad6c0a3e14fc\"><div>Learn about what's new in the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-9fbc3686-b79e-4879-cf36-09a810291a16\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VMware Cloud Foundation</div></span><span class=\"tm\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-e6bb98b0-f61f-48e9-f612-5e88b62c8d62\">™</span> (<span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-65167df8-cd3e-4306-982a-20d058905969\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span>) 9.0.x releases, the software components and versions included in the Bill of Materials (BOM), product support notes, and known issues.</div></div>\n<div><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-81a0335f-6c0d-4e82-d505-bbdb98af717f\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-4d8fc9de-026d-4fb4-9cc5-ca77442e1654\"><div>In This Chapter</div></h2>\n<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-eb907476-ab14-4403-8826-7b8b3fbde911\"><div><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-42a9d334-c5b3-497a-8655-a08e582123b6\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-277b3000-e774-4bed-8b3b-051f708056fa\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/release-notes/vmware-cloud-foundation-90-release-notes.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0 Release Notes</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-1336c689-5fa7-48e1-d43b-2620720c3696\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/vmware-cloud-foundation-9-0-1-release-notes.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0.1.0 Release Notes</a></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-d5d8e14c-6b9e-4254-d984-97d5a0d1402c\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/release-notes/vmware-cloud-foundation-9-0-2-release-notes.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0.2.0 Release Notes</a></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-9d242c0f-6c01-4f64-aed4-4f137de98752\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/release-notes/patch-releases-9-0-0-x.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Patch Releases 9.0.x</a></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-afb2a90a-a704-4e29-abce-bd4328e1298a\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-f735653e-9eb2-4053-9d5d-b52aa80206e2-en_id-a0780557-dee0-4303-8f6a-b12b3d47430a\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-0/release-notes/vmware-cloud-foundation-async-releases.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Async Releases</a></div></div></div></li></div></ul></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
