    "title": "Overview",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-876b235c-219b-4b87-e5f7-08df3bd16110\"><div>Overview</div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-40e2224e-6f0e-46ec-cfcb-4352ee702f2c\"><div>Understand the architecture and capabilities of <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-ae2c8b5c-bdaa-4e1d-e2cc-34c1ffad4fb2\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> across the stages in the private cloud lifecycle.</div></div>\n<div><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-bdfbf492-6624-4657-a569-48c4cd3f3adb\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-222443d6-2036-4a50-812b-16c04af0b3cb\"><div>In This Chapter</div></h2>\n<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-561c0bde-e25b-4e9a-e918-be09d3a00557\"><div><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-8cbfbe7c-d7c3-4e3b-d922-47013a9a9875\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-fe74012c-8b7f-45c8-cae1-e016351ee04e\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/what-is-vmware-cloud-foundation-and-vmware-vsphere-foundation.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">What Is VMware Cloud Foundation?</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-4ad75b2d-c465-4787-aa21-a613fec30008\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-89d74bb0-a78f-4b52-bfba-ac40414cdf0f\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/what-is-vsphere-foundation.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">What Is vSphere Foundation?</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-ea2083d2-6a31-443f-b4f2-3e3239fb0edf\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-8d2025d6-037c-47ab-f5e9-9a81c74620bf\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/workload-domains-in-vmware-cloud-foundation.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Taxonomy</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-7e146a37-517b-4978-ff3d-5bc86db7901b\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-32d269cd-2adb-4b2c-c163-48b6ab801a27\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/vcf-capabilities.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Capabilities by Job Function</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-216d1b1c-c6c0-4c0d-8cdb-1600aa68fdd2\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-521bccc0-6361-4345-e117-c3b8904a8a80\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/getting-started-with-vcf.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Getting Started with VMware Cloud Foundation</a></div></div></div></li><li class=\"li\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-0f1b161e-85ec-4854-842d-d70243ea79eb\"><div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-d995cb88-cbdf-49eb-8487-5a56688ec121\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/overview-of-vmware-cloud-foundation-9/getting-started-with-vsphere-foundation.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Getting Started with vSphere Foundation</a></div></div></div></li></div></ul></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-19c8ee35-8a67-4b53-9314-ad397d266c0c\"><div><h2 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-88b5c674-2608-44ef-dbea-ec0738049aa7\"><div>Other Resources for Getting to Know <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-ee8e9c6f-9568-408b-c2e9-b387db676c2f\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span></div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-48fa380f-ea82-4cfe-f000-f5e8b63832f7\"><div>In addition to an overview of the <span class=\"keyword\" id=\"GUID-a336f71b-771d-4d7a-8fe1-ce920f6776ba-en_id-35ac4192-a1d4-4c32-b18b-65719e7a596c\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VCF</div></span> capabilities, see <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">VCF Release Notes</a> and <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/deployment/overview-of-deploy--converge--and-upgrade.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Overview of VCF Deploy, Converge, and Upgrade</a>.</div></div></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
