    "title": "Migration Service Engine 9.1.1.0200 Release Notes",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><div>Migration Service Engine 9.1.1.0200 Release Notes</div></h1>\n<div><div class=\"p\"><div>This document contains the following sections</div></div><ul class=\"ul\"><div><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-1-x/vcf-automation/migration-service-engine-9-1-1-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_introduction\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Introduction</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-1-x/vcf-automation/migration-service-engine-9-1-1-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_what-s-new\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">What's New</a></div></li><li class=\"li\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"dita\" data-scope=\"local\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/release-notes/patch-releases-9-1-1-x/vcf-automation/migration-service-engine-9-1-1-0200-release-notes.html#GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_applying-the-patch\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Applying the Patch</a></div></li></div></ul><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_introduction\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Introduction</div></h2>\n<table class=\"table\">\n<div>\n<!--cq:include script=\"../../common/tablestack.jsp\" /-->\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 100.0%\"/></colgroup>\n<div>\n<tbody class=\"tbody\"><div>\n<tr class=\"row\"><div><td class=\"entry relcol\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-6f15549b-25fb-4820-91b5-814c10638dcb\"><div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-c17b9a74-2f75-4300-908a-3e1489f59af0\"><div>Migration Service Engine 9.1.1.0200 | 12 OCT 2026| Build 25801570</div></div>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-b8e926ee-3f1b-4b5a-9440-e751348a5148\"><div>Check for additions and updates to these release notes.</div></div>\n</div></td></div></tr>\n</div></tbody>\n</div>\n</div>\n</table>\n</div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_what-s-new\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>What's New</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-646d66ff-dca2-4bcb-9051-ed38c221805b\"><div>This release contains various security enhancements.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_applying-the-patch\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Applying the Patch</div></h2>\n<div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-5838ec60-c686-46ea-bb54-bbbac97ca263\"><div>Use the latest available binaries for components when you deploy, upgrade, or patch.</div></div><div class=\"p\" id=\"GUID-73171595-057a-4424-871d-dc24499180c6-en_id-c587c376-9f72-4dd2-9eb2-0c06ba1790eb\"><div>You apply this patch by using VCF Operations. See <a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/bin/gethidpage?ux-context-string=vcf_535&amp;appid=vcf-9-1&amp;language=&amp;format=rendered\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">Upgrade or Patch an Individual VCF Component</a>.</div></div></div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
