  "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vsphere-supervisor-services-and-standalone-components/latest/release-notes/vmware-tanzu-kubernetes-grid-service-release-notes.html": {
    "title": "VMware vSphere Kubernetes Service Release Notes",
    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-166807c0-799a-4122-a5de-59c5d158b3e3-en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><div>VMware vSphere Kubernetes Service Release Notes</div></h1>\n<div><div class=\"p\"><div>The release notes for vSphere Kubernetes Service (VKS) are on the <cite class=\"cite\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VMware Cloud Foundation Service Administration and Development 9.1</div></cite> site. This page directs you to the correct location for the information that you need.</div></div><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-166807c0-799a-4122-a5de-59c5d158b3e3-en_section_1\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>About vSphere Kubernetes Service </div></h2>\n      vSphere Kubernetes Service (VKS) provides components for provisioning and managing the lifecycle of Kubernetes clusters in the vSphere Supervisor environment. VKS follows its own release cadence, independent of the vSphere Supervisor and VCF release numbering. For information about which VKS version ships with each Supervisor release, see the Release Snapshot section of the corresponding vSphere Supervisor release notes.</div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"GUID-166807c0-799a-4122-a5de-59c5d158b3e3-en_section_2\"><div><h2 class=\"title\"><div>Where to Find the Release Notes</div></h2>\n      The release notes for VKS, including details for each VKS release, are on the  <cite class=\"cite\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">VMware Cloud Foundation Service Administration and Development 9.1</div></cite>  site.\n      \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  <table class=\"table\">\n<div>\n<!--cq:include script=\"../../common/tablestack.jsp\" /-->\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 50.0%\"/><col style=\"width: 50.0%\"/></colgroup>\n<div>\n<thead class=\"thead\">\n<div>\n<tr class=\"row\"><div><th class=\"entry\"><div>Information that you need</div></th><th class=\"entry\"><div>Location</div></th></div></tr>\n</div>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"tbody\"><div>\n<tr class=\"row\"><div><td class=\"entry\"><div>VKS release notes, including what's new, known issues, and resolved issues for each VKS release</div></td><td class=\"entry relcol\"><div><a class=\"xref\" data-format=\"html\" data-scope=\"external\" data-type=\"\" href=\"https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-service-administration-and-development/9-1/release-notes/vks-release-notes.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">VMware vSphere Kubernetes Service Release Notes on the VCF Service Administration and Development 9.1 site</a></div></td></div></tr>\n</div></tbody>\n</div>\n</div>\n</table>\n</div></section></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vsphere-supervisor-services-and-standalone-components/latest/release-notes/vmware-tanzu-kubernetes-grid-service-release-notes.html",
    "subpages": []
  },
